---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="关于曦清农业 | XIQING AGRI"
	description="曦清农业是一项正在进行中的自动化农业工程实践，以连续实验验证稳定性、成本、能耗、产量与商业价值。"
	alternatePath="/en/about"
>
	<main>
		<header class="page-hero page-hero--about shell">
			<p class="eyebrow">ABOUT XIQING AGRI</p>
			<div class="page-hero__heading"><h1>关于曦清</h1><p>ENGINEERING AGRICULTURE<br />IN PUBLIC</p></div>
		</header>
		<section class="about-intro section--dark">
			<div class="shell about-intro__grid">
				<p class="eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</p>
				<div>
					<h2>青岛市即墨区曦清智慧农业产业部，是一项正在进行中的自动化农业工程实践。</h2>
					<p>我们的目标不是证明某一种农业技术“先进”，而是通过连续实验回答真实问题。</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="questions-title">
			<div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FIVE QUESTIONS</p><h2 id="questions-title">每轮实验都要回答</h2></div>
			<ol class="big-questions">
				<li><span>01</span>它能否稳定运行？</li><li><span>02</span>成本是多少？</li><li><span>03</span>能耗是多少？</li>
				<li><span>04</span>实际能产多少？</li><li><span>05</span>维护有多复杂，最终有没有商业价值？</li>
			</ol>
			<p class="about-statement">因此，我们公开记录成功，也公开记录失败。</p>
		</section>
		<section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="directions-title">
			<div class="shell">
				<div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH DIRECTIONS</p><h2 id="directions-title">当前研究方向</h2></div>
				<ul class="direction-list">
					<li><span>01</span>气雾培</li><li><span>02</span>自然光利用</li><li><span>03</span>水肥控制</li>
					<li><span>04</span>农业传感器</li><li><span>05</span>自动控制</li><li><span>06</span>模块化种植系统</li><li><span>07</span>低成本工程化</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
